            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.purol.2010.05.004</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of bladder located gastric heterotopy, which has never been described, to our mind in the scientific literature. We discuss the diagnosis and the physiopathological mechanisms that may have been involved in the genesis of such a lesion.</AbstractText>
